  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃん、どうしたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, &lt;Mel&gt;. What's up?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら……あなたは……
もしかして&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃん、かしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh my...you...wouldn't happen
to be &lt;Mel&gt;, would you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272640</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わたしのことを知ってるんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know who I am?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちのご先祖様が
お世話になったとか何とか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I heard one of my ancestors
owed you a great debt...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その似顔絵にそっくりなのよね～
でもそんな長生きなわけないから
あなたもその&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんの子孫？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You look just like in the portrait~ But
wait, you can't have lived that long,
right? Are you &lt;Mel&gt;'s descendant?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、あはははは……
わ、わたしも&lt;Mel&gt;っていうんですよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aah... Ahahahahaha...
M-My name's &lt;Mel&gt;, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなの？
何だかあたしたち、
すごい縁なのかもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really? I feel like we have a
powerful destiny binding us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271632</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なに？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What is it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ&lt;Dio&gt;、タルロウさんの
ダンスの件……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, &lt;Dio&gt;, remember Tarlow
and his dance...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ！　ここなら
お客もいっぱい来そうだし、
相談してみるといいかも！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, yeah! There are a
lot of customers here,
so let's try asking them!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じつは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The truth is...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふむふむ、なるほど……
ダンスの先生か</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmhmhm, I see...
A dance teacher.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それなら、あたしの友達の
母親のいとこの息子の同級生の
先生の親戚がそうだったかも！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Actually, my friend's mother's cousin's
son's friend from the next class over's
teacher's relative is a dance teacher!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さ、さすがに遠くないか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I-Isn't that kinda too distant...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっそく現地に
行ってもらえるように
頼んでみるよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll have her head
over to the place
right away!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272252</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当ですか！？
ありがとうございます！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Really!? Thank you so much!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なーに、他ならぬ
&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃんの頼みとあらば！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No problem! It's a request from
the amazing &lt;Mel&gt;, after all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やったな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, nice!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん！　さっそく
タルロウさんのところに行こう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah! Let's get back to where
Tarlow is right away!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
